+# Private dashboard data
+
+This directory is for local-only content that must never be committed or copied
+into the public `site/` tree. The local dashboard creates missing private JSON
+files with empty safe defaults. Keep real pricing in `pricing.json` and campaign
+budgets/ad planning in `campaigns.json`.
+
+Only this README is tracked. Do not remove the matching `.gitignore` rules.
