codex
The private content is now physically separated and ignored, while the local API still presents `campaigns.json` and `pricing.json` under their familiar logical names. The hosted snapshot is generated from top-level public JSON only, so neither private file can enter the Pages artifact. I’m moving into integration testing now, including the dashboard’s browserless smoke harness.
